{
  "id": "spring-boot-summary-checklist",
  "slug": "summary-checklist",
  "title": "Summary Checklist",
  "category": "Spring Framework",
  "sections": [
    {
      "id": "content",
      "heading": "Summary Checklist",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "list",
          "ordered": false,
          "items": [
            "Spring Boot provides embedded servers (like Tomcat) and in-memory databases (like H2, HSQLDB) out-of-the-box.",
            "Speeds up development and reduces the need for manual configuration in early stages."
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Example:"
        },
        {
          "type": "code",
          "language": "xml",
          "code": "<dependency>\n  <groupId>org.springframework.boot</groupId>\n  <artifactId>spring-boot-starter-web</artifactId>\n</dependency>",
          "runnable": false
        },
        {
          "type": "list",
          "ordered": false,
          "items": [
            "Spring Initializr offers a quick setup for Spring Boot apps.",
            "Automatically includes compatible, tested versions of dependencies."
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Tip: Always select only the needed dependencies to avoid bloat."
        },
        {
          "type": "list",
          "ordered": false,
          "items": [
            "Use: @Controller or @RestController",
            "Controllers should not contain business logic.",
            "They should delegate to services.",
            "Keep them stateless, as they are singletons by default."
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Example:"
        },
        {
          "type": "code",
          "language": "java",
          "code": "@RestController\npublic class EmployeeController {\n    @Autowired\n    private EmployeeService employeeService;\n\n    @GetMapping(\"/employee/{id}\")\n    public Employee getEmployee(@PathVariable int id) {\n        return employeeService.getEmployeeById(id);\n    }\n}",
          "runnable": false
        },
        {
          "type": "list",
          "ordered": false,
          "items": [
            "Encapsulates business logic.",
            "Prefer naming based on domain models: OrderService, CustomerService.",
            "Use one-to-one mapping between controller and service when possible."
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Example:"
        },
        {
          "type": "code",
          "language": "java",
          "code": "@Service\npublic class EmployeeService {\n    public Employee getEmployeeById(int id) {\n        // business logic\n    }\n}",
          "runnable": false
        },
        {
          "type": "list",
          "ordered": false,
          "items": [
            "Spring Boot auto-configures beans based on the classpath and properties.",
            "Works using Spring Starters."
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Example:"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "If spring-boot-starter-data-jpa is present, Spring will configure JPA and DataSource beans automatically."
        },
        {
          "type": "list",
          "ordered": false,
          "items": [
            "Handle exceptions centrally using @ControllerAdvice and @ExceptionHandler."
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Example:"
        },
        {
          "type": "code",
          "language": "java",
          "code": "@ControllerAdvice\npublic class GlobalExceptionHandler {\n\n    @ExceptionHandler(ResourceNotFoundException.class)\n    public ResponseEntity<String> handleNotFound(ResourceNotFoundException ex) {\n        return new ResponseEntity<>(ex.getMessage(), HttpStatus.NOT_FOUND);\n    }\n}",
          "runnable": false
        },
        {
          "type": "list",
          "ordered": false,
          "items": [
            "Avoid: System.out.println",
            "Use SLF4J or Logback via Spring Boot’s logging support.",
            "Define levels: INFO, DEBUG, WARN, ERROR."
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "📝 Example:"
        },
        {
          "type": "code",
          "language": "java",
          "code": "private static final Logger logger = LoggerFactory.getLogger(MyClass.class);\nlogger.info(\"Service started\");",
          "runnable": false
        },
        {
          "type": "list",
          "ordered": false,
          "items": [
            "Follow standard Java conventions: camelCase, lowercase first letter."
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "📝 Examples:"
        },
        {
          "type": "code",
          "language": "java",
          "code": "customerDao, orderService, registrationController",
          "runnable": false
        },
        {
          "type": "list",
          "ordered": false,
          "items": [
            "Ensures immutability.",
            "Encourages clear dependencies.",
            "Use setters for optional dependencies."
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Example:"
        },
        {
          "type": "code",
          "language": "java",
          "code": "@Service\npublic class UserService {\n    private final UserRepository userRepository;\n\n    @Autowired\n    public UserService(UserRepository userRepository) {\n        this.userRepository = userRepository;\n    }\n}",
          "runnable": false
        },
        {
          "type": "list",
          "ordered": false,
          "items": [
            "Enables monitoring of: ",
            "Add to pom.xml:"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "code",
          "language": "xml",
          "code": "<dependency>\n  <groupId>org.springframework.boot</groupId>\n  <artifactId>spring-boot-starter-actuator</artifactId>\n</dependency>",
          "runnable": false
        },
        {
          "type": "list",
          "ordered": false,
          "items": [
            "Recommended to limit endpoint exposure:"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "code",
          "language": "",
          "code": "management.endpoints.web.exposure.include=health,info\nmanagement.endpoints.web.exposure.exclude=env",
          "runnable": false
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Tip: Use /actuator/metrics, /actuator/health, etc. for observability."
        },
        {
          "type": "list",
          "ordered": false,
          "items": [
            "Avoid the default package.",
            "Top-level package should contain the main class.",
            "Group layers:"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "code",
          "language": "",
          "code": "com.infy\n ├── controller\n ├── service\n ├── repository\n └── model",
          "runnable": false
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Helps Spring’s component scan and improves maintainability."
        },
        {
